@startuml
[*] --> LoggedIn : login successful

state LoggedIn
LoggedIn --> MarketConditions : select market conditions
LoggedIn --> PestControlHelp : select pest control help
LoggedIn --> SoilInfo : select soil suggestions
LoggedIn --> WeatherInsights : select weather insights
LoggedIn --> LabourAvailability : select labour availability

state MarketConditions
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : view report
MarketReport --> LoggedIn

state PestControlHelp
PestControlHelp --> PestTechniques : provide photo
PestTechniques --> LoggedIn

state SoilInfo
SoilInfo --> SoilSuggestions : receive soil info
SoilSuggestions --> LoggedIn

state WeatherInsights
WeatherInsights --> WeatherReport : provide location
WeatherReport --> LoggedIn

state LabourAvailability
LabourAvailability --> LabourDetails : provide location
LabourDetails --> LoggedIn

LoggedIn --> [*] : logout
@enduml
